<title>POLAND: PEKPOL SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>PEKPOL SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.11 vs   0.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.22 vs   0.36</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.08 vs   0.43</p>
<p> Sales		   17.48 vs  14.60</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.09 vs   1.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.06 vs   2.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.67 vs   0.91</p>
<p> Sales		  147.84 vs 124.64</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food producer is Pekpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
